# altgo
===
 Altgo is a desktop speech-to-text tool. Simply hold down the trigger key to speak; upon release, it automatically records, transcribes, and optionally polishes the text. The result is copied to the system clipboard and displayed as a single line in a floating window at the bottom of the screen.
